    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "rtt-box",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 17
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "rtt-text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 260,
      "text": "Measured RTT ≈ 15 + 90 + 90 + 15 = ~210ms\nActual direct latency (us-east ↔ fr-par) ≈ ~80ms\n\nOverhead: hub routing adds ~2× the hub-to-nearer-agent latency (30ms in this example)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 18
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section2",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 370,
      "text": "Measurement Process Per Target",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 19
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "process-box",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 200,
      "strokeColor": "#dee2e6",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "process-text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 420,
      "text": "For each of 45 target regions (sequential):\n\n  1. Send NATS Request(\"latency.probe.request.<target>\")\n  2. Wait for reply (3s timeout)\n  3. Record elapsed time → sample[i]\n  4. Repeat 5 times\n\n  5. Sort samples\n  6. Compute: min, max, median (P50), mean\n  7. Publish result to latency.results.<src>.<tgt>\n\nFull sweep of 45 targets ≈ 4 minutes",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 21
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "section3",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 650,
      "text": "Result Payload",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 22
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "payload-box",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "strokeColor": "#dee2e6",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 23
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "payload-text",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 700,
      "text": "{\n  \"source\": \"us-east\",\n  \"target\": \"fr-par\",\n  \"rtt_ms\": 142.35,    ← mean\n  \"min_ms\": 140.12,\n  \"max_ms\": 148.91,\n  \"p50_ms\": 141.87,    ← median\n  \"samples\": 5,\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-03-18T12:04:22Z\"\n}",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 24
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tradeoff-title",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 370,
      "text": "Trade-off: Hub-Routed vs Direct",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 25
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "tradeoff-box",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "strokeColor": "#dee2e6",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "seed": 26
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tradeoff-text",
      "x": 620,
      "y": 420,
      "text": "Hub-routed (what we do):\n✓ Simple: each agent connects to 1 place\n✓ No full mesh (1,035 connections)\n✓ Hub already aggregates data\n✗ RTT includes hub routing overhead\n✗ Not direct region-to-region latency\n\nDirect measurement (alternative):\n✓ True region-to-region latency\n✗ 1,035 direct connections needed\n✗ Each agent needs every other agent's IP\n✗ Separate aggregation layer required\n✗ Complex firewall rules\n\nFor a demo tool showing relative\ndifferences, hub-routed is sufficient.\nUI should note the measurement method.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "seed": 27
    }
  ],
